\newlabel{fig:artifact20}{{3}{4}{Worst-channel artifact under 20~Hz stimulation (red) versus same-day unstimulated reference (grey dashed). (a) One second of raw LFP around the peak ${\sim }7{,}000\,z$ transient, whose multi-hundred-millisecond decay spans several 50~ms periods. (b) Recording folded at 50~ms and high-passed above 5~Hz to isolate periodic structure (cycle-wise median and unclipped interquartile range)}{figure.caption.8}{}}
